sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as React Client (Polling)
    participant Server as Express Server
    participant DB as MongoDB Atlas
    participant AI as FastAPI AI Service
    participant GH as GitHub REST API
    participant OSV as OSV.dev & Registries

    loop Every 3 seconds while searching/analyzing
        Client->>Server: GET /api/ideas/:id/results
        Server->>DB: Check completed Analysis documents
        DB-->>Server: Return active analysis statuses
        Server-->>Client: 200 OK (Progress percentage & available analyses)
    end

    Server->>AI: POST /agents/analyze (repoMetadata, checklist) [X-Request-Id]
    
    activate AI
    AI->>GH: Get repository tree & commit log (read-only)
    GH-->>AI: File listing & historical commits
    
    AI->>GH: Read manifest files (package.json / requirements.txt)
    GH-->>AI: Manifest contents
    
    AI->>OSV: Query known CVEs for extracted dependencies
    OSV-->>AI: Vulnerability records & severities
    
    AI->>GH: Sample high-risk source files for static linting
    GH-->>AI: Source code snippets
    
    AI->>AI: Run Ruff / ESLint rules in read-only sandbox
    AI->>AI: Verifier Agent checks all evidence paths against tree
    AI->>AI: Deterministic Scorer computes Coverage & Viability
    AI->>AI: Revival Planner generates gap list & Founder Brief
    deactivate AI

    AI-->>Server: Complete Analysis Payload
    Server->>DB: Upsert Analysis document
    Server->>Server: Re-compute composite ranking & select Best Match
    Server->>DB: Update Query record with finalized rankings

    Client->>Server: GET /api/ideas/:id/results
    Server-->>Client: 200 OK (Completed Best Match, Alternatives, and Metrics)
